%% Agent lifecycle state machine - ONE enum (>=13 states)
%% Source: blueprint Phase 4/5/6/9/10, UI-WIRING-GUIDE R-U4, UI-COMMANDS-v1 section 4
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> healthy
    [*] --> empty
    [*] --> loading

    healthy --> running : run created
    queued --> running : scheduler dispatch
    running --> planning : plan DAG being built
    planning --> thinking : provider call in flight
    thinking --> streaming : first REPLY_DELTA
    streaming --> running : stream continues
    running --> thinking : next step
    thinking --> awaiting_approval : tool needs approval
    awaiting_approval --> running : approval allowed
    awaiting_approval --> cancelled : approval denied or TTL expiry
    running --> completed : terminal success
    running --> failed : named provider/refusal error
    running --> cancelled : CANCEL_RUN
    running --> killed : KILL_WORKER
    streaming --> completed : REPLY_DONE
    streaming --> failed : provider error mid-stream
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    killed --> [*]

    healthy --> reconnecting : WS drop
    reconnecting --> healthy : hello last_seq resnapshot
    reconnecting --> failed : bounded retries exhausted E_WS_DISCONNECTED

    healthy --> replay : open history revision
    replay --> healthy : leave replay

    note right of empty
        empty/loading are SURFACE states, not agent states
    end note
    note right of awaiting_approval
        blocks approve/deny until single-use nonce decision;
        replay of nonce -> E_APPROVAL_REPLAY
    end note
    note right of replay
        read-only view state from Phase 9 history API
    end note
